        "title": "Fascinating",
        "text": "I found this place fascinating. I would have liked to have seen more but restrictions on access to the Temple apply. A little disappointing but I understand this because this is a very sacred place for Hindus. I respect that. This leaves the main attraction therefore as the cremation area on the bank of the river. Totally alien to Western culture but clearly an important ceremony for Hindus. I think it is well worth a visit to have an insight into their beliefs’. I really enjoyed it.",
